---
// WhyChooseUs.astro
---
<section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-slate-50">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">
        Why Families Trust <span class="text-blue-900">Rofix Service?</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 text-sm md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        We don't just repair water purifiers; we ensure your family gets safe, crystal-clear drinking water every single day. Here is why we are the top choice for RO service in Bangalore.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Cards Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      
      <!-- Card 1: Certified Technicians (Blue) -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300">
        <div class="bg-blue-600 p-6 text-white">
          <svg class="w-10 h-10 mb-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4M7.835 4.697a3.42 3.42 0 001.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 014.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 001.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 013.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010 4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-4.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138-3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010-4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 013.138-3.138z"></path>
          </svg>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold">Expert & Verified Technicians</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5">
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Our RO specialists are highly trained and background-verified. They diagnose the exact issue and fix it correctly the first time.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Fast Doorstep Service (Green) -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300">
        <div class="bg-green-600 p-6 text-white">
          <svg class="w-10 h-10 mb-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
          </svg>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold">Same-Day Doorstep Repair</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5">
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Don't carry your heavy purifier to a shop. Book a slot, and our expert will reach your doorstep within hours to solve the issue.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Genuine Spare Parts (Purple) -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300">
        <div class="bg-purple-600 p-6 text-white">
          <svg class="w-10 h-10 mb-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"></path>
          </svg>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold">100% Genuine Parts & Warranty</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5">
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">We never compromise with your family's health. We use only authorized spare parts backed by a solid 90-day repair warranty.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4: Affordable Pricing (Orange) -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300">
        <div class="bg-orange-500 p-6 text-white">
          <svg class="w-10 h-10 mb-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
          </svg>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold">Transparent & Fair Pricing</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5">
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">No hidden charges, no surprise bills. Get a clear quote before the work starts, ensuring the best service at the most affordable rate.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom CTA -->
    <div class="text-center mt-12">
      <a href="tel:+917090170092" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-blue-900 hover:bg-blue-800 text-white font-bold py-3.5 px-8 rounded-xl shadow-md transition duration-300 text-sm">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-yellow-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z"></path>
        </svg>
        Call for Instant Service
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>